        {
          "title": "Open the corridor",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>Open the corridor from Corridors in <strong>Drones</strong>. <strong>Change shape</strong> redraws it and <strong>Change</strong> edits its name, team and hours.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/905db2e80fe069f2.webp",
              "width": 1336,
              "height": 2782
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "End it",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p><strong>End corridor</strong> asks once. The corridor then leaves the map.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/3243ed63157d1dbe.webp",
              "width": 1336,
              "height": 2782
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "See it ended",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>The page now says when it ended. <strong>Reopen</strong> opens its form again, from now to 12 hours later.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/b5ce6feea136a9f5.webp",
              "width": 1336,
              "height": 2782
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Open the quota",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>Tap <strong>‹</strong>, open Quotas and tap the quota. Its form has <strong>End quota</strong> at the bottom.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/f08632ef1212b73a.webp",
              "width": 1336,
              "height": 2660
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "End a quota",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p><strong>End quota</strong> asks once. Tap <strong>End quota</strong> again to end it.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/21edbce15d76e050.webp",
              "width": 1336,
              "height": 2660
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "See what ended",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>Ended quotas and corridors stay under <strong>Ended</strong> for 7 days.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/4507777c01447df2.webp",
              "width": 1336,
              "height": 2782
            }
